..!interpreter english translate noabbrev
..*****************************************************************************
.. Name           : TSBPRINT.BSTART.BA
.. Author         : mh
.. Verantwortlich : mh
.. Kontrolle      :
.. Functionality  : Create inhouse file, convert into vda format, transfer 
..                  files to tsb utility, wait for results. 
...Includes       :
..  include dfue/TSBPRINT.FILES
..  include dfue/TSBPRINT.ISVDA4939VW.GTL
..  include dfue/TSBPRINT.ISVDA4939VW.TSB
..*****************************************************************************
..!meta M|=dfue/TSBPRINT
.set trans -
.. 
.. The tsb programm is not in its installation directory
.continue NOTSB ? _M|kbtsbinstalliert
.. 
.. Must have in inhouse file
.formula M|kbihssvorhanden = F|fileexists(M|kihssdatei)
.continue NOIHSS  ? _M|kbihssvorhanden
.. 
.. Create VDA file from inhouse file
.input "TSBPRINT.KBUVDAERSTELLEN.BB"
.. 
.. Place VDA file in in-folder of the TSB utility 
.input "TSBPRINT.KBUDATEIUEBERGEBEN.BB"
.. 
.. Wait and check for TSB files and/or GTL files to be generated
.input "TSBPRINT.KBUDATEIENSUCHEN.BB"
.. 
.. Check which files exit and are not empty
.input "TSBPRINT.FILES"
.. 
..*****************************************************************************
!END
.continue
.. 
.. 
!NOIHSS
.error Die Erstellung der Inhousedatei ist fehlgeschlagen.
.end 1
.. 
!NOTSB
.error Bitte prÅfen Sie die Installation des TSB-Generators.
.end 1
